# Quarkify PoC — generated code-topology artifacts (regenerable; do not commit)

# VS Code remote tunnel CLI artifacts
/code
/vscode_cli.tar.gz

# Overnight loop runtime artifacts (scripts/overnight/run.sh) — keep the harness, drop the state
scripts/overnight/logs/
scripts/overnight/STOP
scripts/overnight/DONE
# Per-run review checklist instances generated by /overnight-report (docs/test/history/) — regenerable, keep the bible + folder README only
docs/test/history/*-overnight-review-checklist.md

# Closed-beta invite keys (access gate — never commit)
INVITE_KEY.md
